# ios/ and android/ are generated output in this project (both are gitignored and
# rebuilt by prebuild), so they are not fingerprint inputs. EAS runs prebuild
# before computing the runtime version and then hashed the resulting ios/ as a
# "bareNativeDir", while a machine that had never prebuilt had nothing to hash --
# the two could never agree. What actually determines the native project is the
# config, the plugins and the dependency set, and those are still hashed.
ios/**/*
android/**/*
